---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Treatments | PureMed Aesthetics — Winslow, Buckinghamshire"
  description="Medically-led aesthetic treatments in Winslow, Buckinghamshire. Laser Lift, Liquid Facelift, Polynucleotides, RF Microneedling, Skin Boosters, Anti-Wrinkle. Personally delivered by Nafisa Mughal."
  activePath="/treatments"
>

<!-- PAGE HERO -->
<section class="tx-hero">
  <div class="tx-hero-bg">
    <img src="/assets/web/nafisa-20-seedream5lite-v1.webp" alt="" data-stage-img="img-nafisa-20-seedream5lite-v1">
  </div>
  <div class="tx-hero-stripe"></div>
  <div class="tx-hero-content">
    <div class="tx-hero-eyebrow">
      <div class="tx-hero-eyebrow-line"></div>
      <span class="tx-hero-eyebrow-text" data-stage-id="medically-led-aesthetics-winslow-buckinghamshire">Medically-Led Aesthetics &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Winslow, Buckinghamshire</span>
    </div>
    <h1 data-stage-id="our">Our <em>Treatments</em></h1>
    <p class="tx-hero-desc" data-stage-id="tx-hero-desc">Every treatment is personally delivered by Nafisa Mughal, medically trained, anatomy-expert, and entirely focused on results that look like you.</p>
    <div class="tx-hero-stats">
      <div class="tx-hero-stat">
        <span class="tx-hero-stat-num" data-stage-id="6">6</span>
        <span class="tx-hero-stat-lbl" data-stage-id="specialist-treatments">Specialist Treatments</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tx-hero-stat-div"></div>
      <div class="tx-hero-stat">
        <span class="tx-hero-stat-num" data-stage-id="90-3">90</span>
        <span class="tx-hero-stat-lbl" data-stage-id="five-star-reviews">Five-Star Reviews</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tx-hero-stat-div"></div>
      <div class="tx-hero-stat">
        <span class="tx-hero-stat-num" data-stage-id="14-3">14+</span>
        <span class="tx-hero-stat-lbl" data-stage-id="years-experience-2">Years' Experience</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="https://facesconsent.com/v1/bookings/puremedaesthetics?clinicSlug=puremed-aesthetics-466185" class="tx-hero-cta" data-stage-id="cta-tx-hero" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg>Book Consultation</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LASER LIFT -->
<section class="tx-section" id="laser-lift" style="background:var(--warm-white)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tx-section-inner">
      <div class="tx-section-content fade-up">
        <span class="tx-section-label" style="color:var(--gold)" data-stage-id="our-signature-treatment">
          <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="var(--gold)" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          Our Signature Treatment
        </span>
        <h2 class="tx-section-title" data-stage-id="tx-laser-lift-title">Laser Lift<br><em>Skin Tightening</em></h2>
        <p class="tx-section-intro" data-stage-id="tx-laser-lift-intro">A precision non-surgical treatment that tightens and lifts from within using Endolift fibre-optic laser technology. No scalpel, no general anaesthetic. Natural results that continue improving for months as new collagen forms.</p>

        <div class="tx-metrics">
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="60-min">60 min</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="session-length">Session length</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="1-2">1–2</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="sessions-needed">Sessions needed</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="minimal">Minimal</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="downtime">Downtime</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="18-24-mo">18–24 mo</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="results-duration">Results duration</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-how">
          <p class="tx-how-heading" data-stage-id="how-it-works-2">How it works</p>
          <div class="tx-steps">
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="1-3">1</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-laser-lift-step-1">An ultrafine Endolift fibre is guided under the skin via a pinpoint entry, no incisions, no stitches.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="2-2">2</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-laser-lift-step-2">Laser energy heats the subcutaneous tissue, causing an immediate contraction and lift effect.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="3-2">3</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-laser-lift-step-3">Ongoing collagen remodelling builds over 3–6 months, progressively improving firmness and definition.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-ideal">
          <p class="tx-ideal-heading" data-stage-id="ideal-if-you-have">Ideal if you have</p>
          <ul class="tx-ideal-list">
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="laser-lift-ideal-1">Skin laxity on the face, jaw or neck you want to lift</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="laser-lift-ideal-2">Wanted to lift and tighten without surgery or significant downtime</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="laser-lift-ideal-3">Results that build progressively over 3–6 months</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="laser-lift-ideal-4">Long-term collagen stimulation rather than volume replacement</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-cta-row">
          <a href="https://facesconsent.com/v1/bookings/puremedaesthetics?clinicSlug=puremed-aesthetics-466185" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-stage-id="cta-tx-laser-lift"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg>Book Laser Lift Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tx-section-img fade-up">
        <img src="/assets/web/puremed-numbing-cream-prep-hf-v1.webp" alt="Laser Lift Skin Tightening at PureMed Aesthetics" style="object-position:center 38%" data-stage-img="img-puremed-numbing-cream-prep-hf">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LIQUID FACELIFT -->
<section class="tx-section tx-section--flip" id="liquid-facelift" style="background:var(--white)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tx-section-inner">
      <div class="tx-section-img fade-up">
        <img src="/assets/web/puremed-laser-lift-hero-4.webp" alt="Liquid Facelift with Dermal Fillers at PureMed Aesthetics" style="object-position:center 15%" data-stage-img="img-puremed-laser-lift-hero-4">
      </div>
      <div class="tx-section-content fade-up">
        <span class="tx-section-label" style="color:var(--mid-grey)" data-stage-id="dermal-fillers">Dermal Fillers</span>
        <h2 class="tx-section-title" data-stage-id="tx-liquid-facelift-title">Liquid Facelift<br><em>with Dermal Fillers</em></h2>
        <p class="tx-section-intro" data-stage-id="tx-liquid-facelift-intro">Precisely placed dermal fillers that restore lost volume, lift sagging areas and redefine facial contours. Same-day results with no surgery, no scalpel, no recovery period.</p>

        <div class="tx-metrics">
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="60-min-2">60 min</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="session-length-2">Session length</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="1-4">1</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="session-needed">Session needed</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="minimal-2">Minimal</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="bruising-risk">Bruising risk</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="12-18-mo">12–18 mo</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="results-duration-2">Results duration</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-how">
          <p class="tx-how-heading" data-stage-id="how-it-works-3">How it works</p>
          <div class="tx-steps">
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="1-5">1</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-liquid-facelift-step-1">A detailed facial assessment maps areas of volume loss, sagging and asymmetry to plan precise placement.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="2-3">2</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-liquid-facelift-step-2">Hyaluronic acid filler is strategically injected to restore structure, reposition tissue and redefine contours.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="3-3">3</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-liquid-facelift-step-3">Results are immediate. Final outcome is visible at two weeks as any minor swelling fully settles.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-ideal">
          <p class="tx-ideal-heading" data-stage-id="ideal-if-you-have-2">Ideal if you have</p>
          <ul class="tx-ideal-list">
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="liquid-facelift-ideal-1">Volume loss in the cheeks, temples or under-eyes</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="liquid-facelift-ideal-2">Softening jawline definition or deepening nasolabial folds</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="liquid-facelift-ideal-3">Wanted natural rejuvenation without surgical risk or recovery</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="liquid-facelift-ideal-4">Results you can adjust or reverse over time if needed</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-cta-row">
          <a href="https://facesconsent.com/v1/bookings/puremedaesthetics?clinicSlug=puremed-aesthetics-466185" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-stage-id="cta-tx-liquid-facelift"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg>Book Liquid Facelift Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ANTI-WRINKLE -->
<section class="tx-section" id="anti-wrinkle" style="background:var(--warm-white)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tx-section-inner">
      <div class="tx-section-content fade-up">
        <span class="tx-section-label" style="color:var(--mid-grey)" data-stage-id="muscle-relaxing-injections">Muscle-Relaxing Injections</span>
        <h2 class="tx-section-title" data-stage-id="tx-anti-wrinkle-title">Anti-Wrinkle<br><em>Injections</em></h2>
        <p class="tx-section-intro" data-stage-id="tx-anti-wrinkle-intro">Targeted injections that smooth dynamic lines and prevent new ones forming, preserving your natural expression while giving a fresher, more rested appearance. Results visible within days.</p>

        <div class="tx-metrics">
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="30-min">30 min</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="session-length-3">Session length</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="1-6">1</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="session-needed-2">Session needed</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="none">None</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="downtime-2">Downtime</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="3-4-mo">3–4 mo</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="results-duration-3">Results duration</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-how">
          <p class="tx-how-heading" data-stage-id="how-it-works-4">How it works</p>
          <div class="tx-steps">
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="1-7">1</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-anti-wrinkle-step-1">Target areas are carefully assessed and marked to preserve natural movement and avoid a frozen look.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="2-4">2</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-anti-wrinkle-step-2">A muscle-relaxing solution is precisely injected into specific muscles using ultra-fine needles.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="3-4">3</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-anti-wrinkle-step-3">Results appear within 3–5 days and are fully visible at two weeks. A top-up review is included.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-ideal">
          <p class="tx-ideal-heading" data-stage-id="ideal-if-you-have-3">Ideal if you have</p>
          <ul class="tx-ideal-list">
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="anti-wrinkle-ideal-1">Forehead lines, frown lines (11s) or crow's feet to reduce</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="anti-wrinkle-ideal-2">Wanted a subtle brow lift or more open, rested-looking eyes</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="anti-wrinkle-ideal-3">Interest in a preventative approach to ageing well</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="anti-wrinkle-ideal-4">A quick, no-downtime treatment with natural-looking results</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-cta-row">
          <a href="https://facesconsent.com/v1/bookings/puremedaesthetics?clinicSlug=puremed-aesthetics-466185" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-stage-id="cta-tx-anti-wrinkle"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg>Book Anti-Wrinkle Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tx-section-img fade-up">
        <img src="/assets/web/puremed-patient-consultation-hf-v1.webp" alt="Anti-Wrinkle Injections at PureMed Aesthetics" style="object-position:55% top" data-stage-img="img-puremed-patient-consultation-hf-v1">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- POLYNUCLEOTIDES -->
<section class="tx-section tx-section--flip" id="polynucleotides" style="background:var(--white)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tx-section-inner">
      <div class="tx-section-img fade-up">
        <img src="/assets/web/puremed-polynucleotides-prep-hf-v1.png" alt="Polynucleotides skin regeneration at PureMed Aesthetics" style="object-position:center 35%" data-stage-img="img-puremed-polynucleotides-prep-hf-v1">
      </div>
      <div class="tx-section-content fade-up">
        <span class="tx-section-label" style="color:var(--mid-grey)" data-stage-id="skin-regeneration">Skin Regeneration</span>
        <h2 class="tx-section-title" data-stage-id="tx-polynucleotides-title">Polynucleotides<br><em>Skin Regeneration</em></h2>
        <p class="tx-section-intro" data-stage-id="tx-polynucleotides-intro">An innovative injectable treatment using purified DNA fragments to repair and regenerate skin at a cellular level, improving quality, hydration and firmness where topical products cannot reach.</p>

        <div class="tx-metrics">
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="45-min">45 min</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="session-length-4">Session length</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="3-5">3</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="sessions-needed-2">Sessions needed</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="minimal-3">Minimal</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="downtime-3">Downtime</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tx-metric">
            <div class="tx-metric-val" data-stage-id="from-4-wks">From 4 wks</div>
            <div class="tx-metric-lbl" data-stage-id="results-visible">Results visible</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-how">
          <p class="tx-how-heading" data-stage-id="how-it-works-5">How it works</p>
          <div class="tx-steps">
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="1-8">1</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-polynucleotides-step-1">Purified DNA strands (PDRN) are injected into targeted areas of skin needing repair and regeneration.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="2-5">2</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-polynucleotides-step-2">PDRN activates fibroblast cells, triggering a natural repair cascade and stimulating fresh collagen synthesis.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tx-step">
              <div class="tx-step-num" data-stage-id="3-6">3</div>
              <p class="tx-step-text" data-stage-id="tx-polynucleotides-step-3">Skin quality, hydration and firmness improve progressively across 6–8 weeks and continue after the course.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-ideal">
          <p class="tx-ideal-heading" data-stage-id="ideal-if-you-have-4">Ideal if you have</p>
          <ul class="tx-ideal-list">
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="polynucleotides-ideal-1">Dull, tired or dehydrated skin that lacks quality and glow</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="polynucleotides-ideal-2">Early to moderate laxity and fine lines to address naturally</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="polynucleotides-ideal-3">Dark circles or hollowness under the eyes</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              <span data-stage-id="polynucleotides-ideal-4">Wanted to maintain and enhance results from other treatments</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="tx-cta-row">
          <a href="https://facesconsent.com/v1/bookings/puremedaesthetics?clinicSlug=puremed-aesthetics-466185" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-stage-id="cta-tx-polynucleotides"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg>Book Polynucleotides Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RF MICRONEEDLING -->
<section class="tx-section" id="rf-microneedling" style="background:var(--warm-white)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tx-section-inner">
      <div class="tx-section-content fade-up">
        <span class="tx-section-label" style="color:var(--mid-grey)" data-stage-id="energy-based-treatment">Energy-Based Treatment</span>
        <h2 class="tx-section-title" data-stage-id="tx-rf-microneedling-title">RF Microneedling<br><em>Skin Tightening</em></h2>
        <p class="tx-section-intro" data-stage-id="tx-rf-microneedling-intro">A dual-action treatment combining microneedling with radiofrequency energy to stimulate deep collagen production, improving texture, firmness and tone with minimal downtime. Results build across a course of sessions.</p>

